# Manual API tests for the IntelliJ HTTP Client
# start the app first, then hit the green play button next to a request
# note: data is in-memory, restart the app to get the seed data back

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### API info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/info

### GET all
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects

### GET only hazardous ones (filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects?hazardous=true

### GET only harmless ones (filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects?hazardous=false

### GET by id (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/1

### GET by id that doesn't exist (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/9999

### Number of tracked objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/count

### POST - create a new object (201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eros",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 16.84,
  "potentiallyHazardous": false,
  "closeApproachDate": "2056-01-25",
  "missDistanceKm": 27000000.0
}

### PUT - replace the whole object (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "2024 YR4 (revised)",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 0.09,
  "potentiallyHazardous": true,
  "closeApproachDate": "2032-12-22",
  "missDistanceKm": 3200000.0
}

### PUT on unknown id (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost",
  "estimatedDiameterKm": 1.0,
  "potentiallyHazardous": false,
  "closeApproachDate": "2050-01-01",
  "missDistanceKm": 1000000.0
}

### PATCH - toggle hazardous flag (200), run twice to flip it back
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/3/hazardous

### PATCH on unknown id (404)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/9999/hazardous

### DELETE - remove an object (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2

### DELETE again - already gone (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2
